<title>UK: RPT Management says gets approach.</title>
<headline>RPT Management says gets approach.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>British residential property trust RPT Management Services Plc said on Tuesday it received an approach that might lead to an offer being made for the company.</p>
<p>&quot;The board is consulting its financial advisers, Credit Lyonnais Laing, and will release a further announcement as soon as possible,&quot; the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>It did not give further details.</p>
<p>RPT's shares were marked up 23p at 121.5p by 0932 GMT.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
